n thi\u7871\'3ft. Qu\u7929\'3f H\u7895\'3f tr\u7907\'3f ph\'e1t tn\u7875\'3fn th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn b\'e1o c\'e1o }{\f47\insrsid4591797\charrsid4591797 \'f0}{\f0\insrsid4591797\charrsid4591797 \u7897\'3ft xu\u7845\'3ft ho\u7863\'3fc chuy\'ean }{
\f47\insrsid4591797\charrsid4591797 \'f0}{\f0\insrsid4591797\charrsid4591797 \u7873\'3f theo }{\f47\insrsid4591797\charrsid4591797 \'f0}{\f0\insrsid4591797\charrsid4591797 \u7873\'3f ngh\u7883\'3f c\u7911\'3fa B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh.
\par - C\'e1c  bi\u7875\'3fu m\u7851\'3fu b\'e1o c\'e1o th\u7889\'3fng k\'ea s\u7889\'3f li\u7879\'3fu t\'ecnh h\'ecnh th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn t\'edn d\u7909\'3fng h\u7895\'3f tr\u7907\'3f xu\u7845\'3ft kh\u7849\'3fu g\u7891\'3fm:
\par + B\'e1o c\'e1o cho vay ng\u7855\'3fn h\u7841\'3fn  h\u7895\'3f tr\u7907\'3f xu\u7845\'3ft kh\u7849\'3fu (th\'e1ng, n}{\f47\insrsid4591797\charrsid4591797 \'e3}{\f0\insrsid4591797\charrsid4591797 m), M\u7851\'3fu s\u7889\'3f B01-TDXK.
\par + B\'e1o c\'e1o cho vay trung v\'e0 d\'e0i h\u7841\'3fn h\u7895\'3f tr\u7907\'3f xu\u7845\'3ft kh\u7849\'3fu (th\'e1ng, n}{\f47\insrsid4591797\charrsid4591797 \'e3}{\f0\insrsid4591797\charrsid4591797 m) M\u7851\'3fu s\u7889\'3f B02-TDXK.
\par + B\'e1o c\'e1o c\u7845\'3fp HTLSS}{\f47\insrsid4591797\charrsid4591797 \'d0}{\f0\insrsid4591797\charrsid4591797 T t\'edn d\u7909\'3fng h\u7895\'3f tr\u7907\'3f xu\u7845\'3ft kh\u7849\'3fu, M\u7851\'3fu s\u7889\'3f B03- TDXK
\par + B\'e1o c\'e1o b\u7843\'3fo l\'e3nh t\'edn d\u7909\'3fng h\u7895\'3f tr\u7907\'3f xu\u7845\'3ft kh\u7849\'3fu, M\u7851\'3fu s\u7889\'3f B04-TDXK.
\par lX- T\u7893\'3f CH\u7913\'3fc TH\u7921\'3fc HI\u7879\'3fN
\par }{\b\f0\insrsid4591797\charrsid4591797 1. Tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm Qu\u7929\'3f H\u7895\'3f tr\u7907\'3f ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn
\par }{\f0\insrsid4591797\charrsid4591797 a) X\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch t\'edn d\u7909\'3fng h\u7895\'3f tr\u7907\'3f xu\u7845\'3ft kh\u7849\'3fu b\'e1o c\'e1o B\u7897\'3f K\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch v\'e0 }{
